    <description>The user crouches low, both arms extended wide with palms open, and goes completely still. Through the faintest disturbances in the air — breath, heartbeat, the shift of weight — they feel every enemy around them. Their positions, their movements, their weaknesses. All of it arrives as pure sensation before the eye could ever register it.</description>
